      "name": "Rhinoceros Charge",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The rhino Strides twice, then makes a horn Strike. As long as the rhino moved at least 20 feet, the Strike's damage increases to (3d12+5) Piercing Damage. A Medium or smaller creature struck by this attack must succeed at a DC 22 Reflex Saving Throw save or be automatically Shoved back 5 feet and knocked Prone by the force of the blow.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
